+
+**What to implement:** Keep Card shells/public props and route bar, line, and pie/donut surfaces through shared components. Preserve orientation, dots, series colors, legends, percentages, date/value formatting, height, and exact empty copy. Remove Recharts-specific payload types/comments.
+
+**TDD:** Add failing component tests for each public prop combination, empty data, labels, product selectors, accessible names, exact summary/caption/table headers and plotted values, and table persistence on engine failure. Implement without changing dashboard data preparation; run focused tests, Roadmap lint/typecheck/tests/build and the boundary scan.
+
+**Commit:** `refactor(roadmap-web): migrate analytics charts to shared adapter`
+
+**Expected:** analytics cards expose the same product API with no engine import.
+
+## Task 7: Migrate Roadmap strategy alignment charts
+
+**PR:** Roadmap strategy migration (<=300 production lines)
+
