+## YAGNI and stage gates
+
+- Every task maps directly to a success criterion or inventoried consumer.
+- No task adds Canvas, new dashboards, new data models, a generic grammar escape hatch, or app engine selection.
+- Each task gets RED-GREEN-REFACTOR, spec review, then quality review in DEV. Validation/ship/review are separately authorized stages.
+- Stop and return to PLAN if the exact package status/API changed, an app migration exceeds 300 added/modified production lines, the wrapper-retirement PR adds replacement production code or deletes anything else, a chart requires engine types in an app, or parity/observation evidence cannot be proven without changing product behavior.
